Landmarks (B.1-B.4) do not interconnect, per `patterns/region/Wild.md` - each is reachable
independently by roaming the region. B.7's Hidden connection to its parent Landmark B.2 is
a normal edge (a broken shell that's plainly there once B.2 is searched); B.8's Secret
connection to its parent B.7 is hidden, since finding it takes the Diggers' fresh cart-ruts
as a trigger. The hidden edge from B.8 onward to C.10 is the physical link on to Ingaraz
that Region B's Secrets field names but doesn't mark on any map the keep holds.
